<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4804] Remove duplicated properties in parent-pom</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4804</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;ignite\parent\pom.xml &#1089;ontains duplicated properties.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;...
&amp;lt;properties&amp;gt;
   ...
   &amp;lt;hadoop.version&amp;gt;2.4.1&amp;lt;/hadoop.version&amp;gt;
   &amp;lt;spark.version&amp;gt;1.5.2&amp;lt;/spark.version&amp;gt;
   &amp;lt;spring.version&amp;gt;4.1.0.RELEASE&amp;lt;/spring.version&amp;gt;
   ...
   &amp;lt;hadoop.version&amp;gt;2.4.1&amp;lt;/hadoop.version&amp;gt;
   ...
   &amp;lt;spark.version&amp;gt;1.5.2&amp;lt;/spark.version&amp;gt;
   ...
   &amp;lt;spring.version&amp;gt;4.1.0.RELEASE&amp;lt;/spring.version&amp;gt;
   ...
&amp;lt;/properties&amp;gt;
...
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In case of their separate change it can result in not expected behavior.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
